{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29149","headline":"送元昼上人归苏州兼寄张厚二首 一 · 许浑","name":"送元昼上人归苏州兼寄张厚二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自卜闲居荆水头，感时相别思悠悠。\n一樽酒尽青山暮，千里书回碧树秋。\n深巷久贫知寂寞，小诗多病尚风流。\n昼公此去应相问，爲说沾巾忆旧游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}